ces throughout; the education disagreement is material but not the only issue in the conversation.", "The August 4, 2025 exchange is primarily about voice lesson scheduling, with education being a secondary point of tension; it is borderline but included because Art's claim about school only happening at his house is directly challenged.", "The December 23, 2025 and July 1, 2026 exchanges occur within much larger custody disputes; the education-related portions are distinct passages but are embedded in broader conflicts about custody, kidnapping allegations, and financial support.", "It is unclear from the messages alone whether Olivia's education was genuinely neglected or whether the accusations reflect the parties' competing narratives; the evidence preserves both positions without resolving which is accurate."]}, "evidence_range_count": 4}}
